# Policy: everything is tracked EXCEPT (a) model-weight files (*.pt/*.pth/*.bin/*.ckpt above,
# excluded by type regardless of size) and (b) individual files too large for GitHub (100MB
# hard limit per file), listed explicitly below. Charts, JSON/CSV, small .npz, rollout videos,
# and wandb run logs are all tracked. See ARTIFACTS.md.
!main_project/**/*.log
!wandb_archive/**/*.log
# tiny vendored map/metadata files that happen to use the .pt extension (not model weights)
!reference_repos_MPPI/**/*.pt

# Oversized cached arrays (each 250MB-2GB) — regenerable by the scripts that wrote them
main_project/eval/linear_probe_image_data.npz
main_project/linear_probe_MLP_output_charts/ground_truth_data*.npz

# Oversized wandb binary run log (113MB, exceeds GitHub's 100MB per-file limit)
main_project/wandb_archive/run-20260701_121452-0tjfay81/run-0tjfay81.wandb

uv.lock